        "4. What is the loss or metric?\n",
        "5. Does the metric match the desired behavior?\n",
        "6. What is the uncertainty of the estimate?\n",
        "7. Are subgroups or domains evaluated separately?\n",
        "8. Are errors qualitatively inspected?\n",
        "9. Are failure cases reported?\n",
        "10. Could the model optimize the metric while failing the real task?\n",
        "\n",
        "## 20.20 Worked example: evaluating a mini sentiment classifier\n",
        "\n",
        "Suppose a sentiment classifier outputs the following probabilities for the positive class:\n",
